===Etymology===
From earlier *parma; probably [[onomatopoeia]]. Cognates include Estonian {{term|parm|lang=et}}, Votic {{term|paarma|lang=vot}}, Livonian {{term|pārmaz}}, and Mari {{term|pormo}}.<ref>{{R:Hakkinen 2004}}</ref>

